\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">MicroWars</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_5991229\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_4459528\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-height=\"360\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 360px\" class=\"game_frame start_maximized game_pending\" data-width=\"640\"><div class=\"restore_wrapper\"><button class=\"restore_btn button\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Restore game</button></div><div data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/17360770/index.html&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" class=\"iframe_placeholder\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><div style=\"max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 5px\">\r\n  <span style=\"color: #22aa22\">Evolve.</span>\r\n  <span style=\"color: #3366dd\">Expand.</span>\r\n  <span style=\"color: #dd3333\">Dominate.</span>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0\">\r\n  A petri dish. Rival colonies. Only one survives.\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 16px 0\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDQ0MzgzOC8yNjUzODI2MS5naWY=/original/aCqg7E.gif\" alt=\"MicroWars gameplay\" style=\"max-width: 100%\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n</p>\r\n<hr style=\"margin: 20px 0\">\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px\">\r\n  <strong>MicroWars</strong> is a free single-player auto-battler roguelike with card drafting.\r\n  Grow your microbe colony on a petri dish, capture strategic objectives, draft evolution cards,\r\n  and crush rival colonies in real-time blob combat.\r\n</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 8px\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<ul style=\"font-size: 14px; padding-left: 20px\">\r\n  <li>Real-time <strong>blob combat</strong> and colony growth</li>\r\n  <li>Draft from <strong>80+ evolution cards</strong> across 4 rarities</li>\r\n  <li><strong>3 colony types</strong> &mdash; Bacterium, Archon, Mutagen &mdash; each with unique combat</li>\r\n  <li><strong>4 unique bosses</strong> &mdash; Titan, Mimic, Plague, Hydra</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Tournament mode</strong> &mdash; 24 AI participants, 6 rounds, Swiss format</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Meta-progression</strong> &mdash; unlock new types and cards, no power creep</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 15px\">\r\n  \u23f1 <strong>15\u201325 minutes</strong> per run &mdash; perfect for quick sessions\r\n</p>\r\n<hr style=\"margin: 20px 0\">\r\n<div style=\"padding: 10px 16px; margin: 20px 0\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px\">\r\n    \ud83d\udea7 <strong>Early Access</strong> &mdash; Balance, content, and features are being added regularly.\r\n    Your feedback shapes the game.\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 24px 0\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/UGft64vM6\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">\r\n    \ud83d\udcac Join the Discord\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 13px\">\r\n  Bug reports, suggestions, and ideas &mdash; all welcome!<br>\r\n  I actively respond to all feedback and push updates the same day.\r\n</p>\r\n</div></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" height=\"6\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_9303039\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\